ReXGlue input: direct mouse look (raw mouse movement for the game to turn by).

With SetMouseDirect(true), the keyboard-and-mouse driver stops adding mouse movement to the
right stick and keeps the counts instead, for the game to take with ConsumeMouseDelta(). So a
game hook can turn the camera by exactly the mouse's movement, skipping the game's stick
dead zone, turn rates and acceleration. Off by default (stock behaviour); keys bound to the
right stick keep working either way. Idea: WetRecomp's native mouse look (nikolaygorb).

